# Project Proposal

Thank you for proposing a new project for the Mettelo community.

Mettelo exists to help data and AI professionals build real-world experience through meaningful collaboration. Every project should solve a genuine problem, encourage learning, and create value for contributors and the wider community.

Please complete this template with as much detail as possible.

---

